  "Andrey Astafyev (Day 6) — expert archaeologist on Kyzylkala fortress and Zoroastrian nomadic sites": "Andrey Astafyev (Jour 6) — archéologue expert de la forteresse de Kyzylkala et des sites nomades zoroastriens",
