  "From the foothills to the singing-dune steppe — each landscape with its own pace and light.": "从山麓丘陵到鸣沙草原——每一片风景都有其独特的节奏与光影。",
  "From a forty-minute drive into the foothills to a singing-dune steppe two and a half hours east — each destination with its own pace, its own light, its own way of being travelled.": "从驱车四十分钟抵达的山麓，到向东两个半小时的鸣沙草原——每处目的地都有其独特的节奏、光影与旅行方式。",
