  "Ten locations across Kazakhstan — all designed and operated end-to-end by our team: own vehicles, own camps, own guides. Choose the landscape that matches your pace.": "哈萨克斯坦境内十处目的地——由我们团队全程设计运营：自备车辆、自设营地、自有向导。选择与您节奏相契的风景。",
