  "The park holds the Singing Dune (150 m barchan with acoustic properties), the Oshaktas menhirs, Kosbastau sacred springs (a 700-year-old willow, radon waters), the Katutau volcanic mountains (300-million-year-old basalt), and the Aktau coloured range — twenty distinct mineral bands in white, red, ochre and blue. Night one is a wild camp under Altyn-Emel's deep sky.": "公园内汇聚诸多奇景：鸣沙丘（高150米的新月形沙丘，具声学共鸣特性）、Oshaktas石阵、Kosbastau圣泉（700年古柳、氡泉）、卡图陶火山山脉（3亿年玄武岩），以及Aktau彩色山脉——白、红、赭、蓝二十层各异的矿物色带。第一夜，在Altyn-Emel深邃星空下野营。",
