  "Private 4WD expedition vehicles all 11 days, with raft and boat sections": "全程11天私人四驱探险车，含橡皮艇与船只路段",
  "English-speaking expedition guide plus local guides at key sites": "英语探险向导，并在关键地点配备当地向导",
  "10 nights accommodation — high camps, silk houses, hotels and a desert yurt camp": "10晚住宿——高山营地、丝绸之家、酒店与荒漠毡房营地",
  "Full board throughout, including family-hosted meals": "全程含全餐，包括主人家招待的家庭餐食",
  "All entrance fees and permits across four countries": "四国所有门票与许可费用",
  "All border registration and paperwork (five crossings)": "所有边境登记与文书手续（五次过境）",
  "International flights to Almaty and home": "往返阿拉木图的国际航班",
  "Visas where required for the four countries": "四国所需的签证（如适用）",
  "Travel insurance with medical evacuation cover (required)": "含医疗后送保障的旅行保险（必备）",
  "Pre- and post-expedition hotel nights in Almaty": "探险前后的阿拉木图酒店住宿",
  "Eleven days. One river. Four countries.": "十一天。一条河。四个国家。",
  "The inaugural departure is forming now, limited to 15 travellers. Tell us your dates and group — we reply within 48 hours with a full proposal.": "首发团正在组建中，限15位旅者。告知我们您的日期与团队——我们将在48小时内回复完整方案。",
