/* === Expedition Standards / How We Travel content update === */
Object.assign(window.I18N.ru, {"Hard caps: up to 12 on expeditions, up to 15 on escapes.": "Жёсткие лимиты: до 12 человек в экспедиции и до 15 — в коротких выездах.", "Maximum 12 on expeditions, 15 on escapes. You will know the name and the village of the person leading you before you arrive.": "Максимум 12 в экспедициях, 15 в коротких выездах. Вы будете знать имя и аул человека, который вас поведёт, ещё до приезда.", "Book by August of the previous year. If your trip is spontaneous, write to us — we will try to arrange it.": "Бронируйте до августа предыдущего года. Если поездка спонтанная — напишите нам, постараемся организовать.", "Off-road-prepared 4×4": "Внедорожник, подготовленный для бездорожья", "Recovery & evacuation vehicle": "Эвакуационная машина", "Supply & logistics 4×4": "Машина снабжения и логистики", "An equipped evacuation vehicle, prepared for heavy off-road.": "Эвакуационная машина с оборудованием, подготовленная для тяжёлого бездорожья.", "Drives the lead vehicle. Final call on weather, route, evacuation. First-response trained.": "Ведёт головную машину. Последнее слово по погоде, маршруту, эвакуации. Обучен первой помощи.", "Drives the second vehicle. Second medical responder, recovery specialist, translator for Kazakh / Russian.": "Ведёт вторую машину. Второй медик, специалист по эвакуации, переводчик с казахского / русского.", "Comfortable jeeps prepared for off-road. 3 guests + driver-guide. A classic expedition platform for Central Asian conditions. Extended fuel range, low-range gearing and factory locking differentials give confident progress off-road. Depending on the route, a snorkel and extra preparation for water crossings are fitted.": "Комфортные джипы, подготовленные для бездорожья. 3 гостя + водитель-гид. Классическая экспедиционная платформа для условий Центральной Азии. Увеличенный запас топлива, понижающая передача и заводские блокировки обеспечивают уверенное движение по бездорожью. В зависимости от маршрута используется шноркель и дополнительная подготовка для водных препятствий.", "Four-wheel-drive vehicles for technical supply throughout the expedition, used both on extremely broken tracks and on the highway. They carry tents, water, kitchen equipment, a generator, spare wheels and fuel. On days when we move between camps, the support vehicle goes ahead so the camp is always fully ready when guests arrive.": "Полноприводные машины для технического снабжения на протяжении всей экспедиции. Используются на участках как с экстремально разбитыми дорогами, так и по трассам. Перевозят палатки, воду, кухонное оборудование, генератор, запасные колёса и топливо. В дни переходов между лагерями машина уходит вперёд, чтобы лагерь всегда был полностью готов к прибытию гостей.", "At the fixed YurtaDa camps — Kargaly, Assy, Charyn, Altyn-Emel — there is a permanent kitchen, showers, bio-toilets, and autonomous power from a hybrid of solar panels and a diesel generator. Mobile camps mirror this kit on a smaller footprint.": "В стационарных лагерях YurtaDa — Каргалы, Ассы, Чарын, Алтын-Эмель — предусмотрены постоянная кухня, душ, биотуалеты и автономное энергоснабжение на гибридной системе солнечных панелей и дизель-генератора. Мобильные лагеря повторяют это оснащение в меньшем формате.", "A dedicated field cook travels on every multi-day expedition. The kitchen module — twin-burner stoves, propane, a tandoor for bread, refrigeration, filtered water, sealed dry-stores — is set up fresh at each camp.": "На каждой многодневной экспедиции работает отдельный полевой повар. Кухонный модуль — двухконфорочные плиты, пропан, тандыр для хлеба, холодильник, фильтрованная вода, герметичные сухие склады — заново разворачивается в каждом лагере.", "Changes with the region of the route — an eagle hunter (berkutchi) in the Altai, a keeper of traditions in Mangystau, an expert in history and legends on the Aral. Joins the expedition for one to three days. Their role is to provide the context of the place — natural, cultural and practical — grounded in local experience and knowledge.": "Меняется в зависимости от региона маршрута — беркутчи на Алтае, хранитель традиций в Мангистау, знаток истории и легенд на Арале. Присоединяется к экспедиции на 1–3 дня. Его роль — обеспечить контекст места: природный, культурный и практический, основанный на локальном опыте и знаниях.", "No drone use over wildlife. No off-track 4WD. Carbon offsets are calculated and disclosed for every itinerary — not as a selling point, but because the maths matter.": "Никаких дронов над дикими животными. Никакого 4×4 вне дорог. Углеродные компенсации считаются и раскрываются по каждому маршруту — не как маркетинг, а потому что арифметика важна.", "Senior guide, regional specialists, all transport (private 4WD), all accommodation (YurtaDa camps and selected guesthouses), all meals, park entries, permits, fuel, satellite communications.": "Старший гид и региональные специалисты, частный транспорт 4×4 и всё топливо, проживание в лагерях YurtaDa и в палатках на дальних маршрутах, все приёмы пищи, входы в национальные парки и разрешения, спутниковая связь."});
Object.assign(window.I18N.kk, {"Hard caps: up to 12 on expeditions, up to 15 on escapes.": "Қатаң шектеу: экспедицияда 12 адамға дейін, қысқа шығуларда 15-ке дейін.", "Maximum 12 on expeditions, 15 on escapes. You will know the name and the village of the person leading you before you arrive.": "Экспедицияларда ең көбі 12, қысқа шығуларда 15. Сізді бастайтын адамның есімі мен ауылын келместен бұрын білесіз.", "Book by August of the previous year. If your trip is spontaneous, write to us — we will try to arrange it.": "Алдыңғы жылдың тамызына дейін брондаңыз. Егер сапар кенеттен болса — бізге жазыңыз, ұйымдастыруға тырысамыз.", "Off-road-prepared 4×4": "Жол талғамайтын жерге дайындалған 4×4", "Recovery & evacuation vehicle": "Эвакуация көлігі", "Supply & logistics 4×4": "Жабдықтау және логистика көлігі", "An equipped evacuation vehicle, prepared for heavy off-road.": "Ауыр жол талғамайтын жерге дайындалған, жабдықталған эвакуация көлігі.", "Drives the lead vehicle. Final call on weather, route, evacuation. First-response trained.": "Басты көлікті жүргізеді. Ауа райы, маршрут, эвакуация бойынша соңғы шешім — оныкі. Алғашқы көмекке үйретілген.", "Drives the second vehicle. Second medical responder, recovery specialist, translator for Kazakh / Russian.": "Екінші көлікті жүргізеді. Екінші медик, эвакуация маманы, қазақ / орыс тілдерінің аудармашысы.", "Comfortable jeeps prepared for off-road. 3 guests + driver-guide. A classic expedition platform for Central Asian conditions. Extended fuel range, low-range gearing and factory locking differentials give confident progress off-road. Depending on the route, a snorkel and extra preparation for water crossings are fitted.": "Жол жоқ жерге дайындалған жайлы джиптер. 3 қонақ + жүргізуші-гид. Орталық Азия жағдайларына арналған классикалық экспедициялық платформа. Ұлғайтылған отын қоры, төмендетілген беріліс және зауыттық дифференциал құлыптары жол жоқ жерде сенімді жүрісті қамтамасыз етеді. Маршрутқа қарай шноркель мен су кедергілеріне қосымша дайындық орнатылады.", "Four-wheel-drive vehicles for technical supply throughout the expedition, used both on extremely broken tracks and on the highway. They carry tents, water, kitchen equipment, a generator, spare wheels and fuel. On days when we move between camps, the support vehicle goes ahead so the camp is always fully ready when guests arrive.": "Бүкіл экспедиция бойы техникалық жабдықтауға арналған толық жетекті көліктер. Олар өте бұзылған жолдарда да, тас жолдарда да қолданылады. Палаткаларды, суды, ас үй жабдығын, генераторды, қосалқы дөңгелектер мен отынды тасиды. Лагерьлер арасында өтетін күндері көлік алдын ала озып кетеді, сонда лагерь қонақтар келгенде әрдайым толық дайын болады.", "At the fixed YurtaDa camps — Kargaly, Assy, Charyn, Altyn-Emel — there is a permanent kitchen, showers, bio-toilets, and autonomous power from a hybrid of solar panels and a diesel generator. Mobile camps mirror this kit on a smaller footprint.": "YurtaDa стационарлық лагерьлерінде — Қарғалы, Асы, Шарын, Алтын-Емел — тұрақты ас үй, душ, биодәретхана және күн панельдері мен дизель-генератордың гибридті жүйесінен автономды энергиямен қамту қарастырылған. Жылжымалы лагерьлер осы жабдықты шағын форматта қайталайды.", "A dedicated field cook travels on every multi-day expedition. The kitchen module — twin-burner stoves, propane, a tandoor for bread, refrigeration, filtered water, sealed dry-stores — is set up fresh at each camp.": "Әрбір көп күндік экспедицияда жеке дала аспазы жұмыс істейді. Ас үй модулі — екі оттықты плиталар, пропан, нан үшін тандыр, тоңазытқыш, сүзілген су, герметикалық құрғақ қоймалар — әр лагерьде қайтадан жайылады.", "Changes with the region of the route — an eagle hunter (berkutchi) in the Altai, a keeper of traditions in Mangystau, an expert in history and legends on the Aral. Joins the expedition for one to three days. Their role is to provide the context of the place — natural, cultural and practical — grounded in local experience and knowledge.": "Маршрут өңіріне қарай өзгереді — Алтайда бүркітші, Маңғыстауда дәстүр сақтаушы, Аралда тарих пен аңыздарды білетін маман. Экспедицияға 1–3 күнге қосылады. Оның рөлі — жердің табиғи, мәдени және практикалық контекстін жергілікті тәжірибе мен білімге сүйене отырып қамтамасыз ету."});
Object.assign(window.I18N.de, {"Hard caps: up to 12 on expeditions, up to 15 on escapes.": "Harte Obergrenzen: bis zu 12 auf Expeditionen, bis zu 15 auf Escapes.", "Maximum 12 on expeditions, 15 on escapes. You will know the name and the village of the person leading you before you arrive.": "Höchstens 12 auf Expeditionen, 15 auf Escapes. Sie kennen den Namen und das Dorf Ihrer Reiseleitung schon vor der Ankunft.", "Book by August of the previous year. If your trip is spontaneous, write to us — we will try to arrange it.": "Buchen Sie bis August des Vorjahres. Ist Ihre Reise spontan — schreiben Sie uns, wir versuchen, sie möglich zu machen.", "Off-road-prepared 4×4": "Geländetaugliches 4×4", "Recovery & evacuation vehicle": "Bergungs- und Evakuierungsfahrzeug", "Supply & logistics 4×4": "Versorgungs- und Logistik-4×4", "An equipped evacuation vehicle, prepared for heavy off-road.": "Ein ausgerüstetes Evakuierungsfahrzeug, vorbereitet für schweres Gelände.", "Drives the lead vehicle. Final call on weather, route, evacuation. First-response trained.": "Fährt das Führungsfahrzeug. Letzte Entscheidung über Wetter, Route, Evakuierung. In Erster Hilfe ausgebildet.", "Drives the second vehicle. Second medical responder, recovery specialist, translator for Kazakh / Russian.": "Fährt das zweite Fahrzeug. Zweiter Ersthelfer, Bergungsspezialist, Übersetzer für Kasachisch / Russisch.", "Comfortable jeeps prepared for off-road. 3 guests + driver-guide. A classic expedition platform for Central Asian conditions. Extended fuel range, low-range gearing and factory locking differentials give confident progress off-road. Depending on the route, a snorkel and extra preparation for water crossings are fitted.": "Komfortable, geländetaugliche Jeeps. 3 Gäste + Fahrer-Guide. Eine klassische Expeditionsplattform für zentralasiatische Bedingungen. Erweiterte Reichweite, Untersetzungsgetriebe und werkseitige Differenzialsperren sorgen für sicheres Vorankommen im Gelände. Je nach Route werden ein Schnorchel und zusätzliche Ausrüstung für Wasserdurchfahrten montiert.", "Four-wheel-drive vehicles for technical supply throughout the expedition, used both on extremely broken tracks and on the highway. They carry tents, water, kitchen equipment, a generator, spare wheels and fuel. On days when we move between camps, the support vehicle goes ahead so the camp is always fully ready when guests arrive.": "Allradfahrzeuge für die technische Versorgung während der gesamten Expedition, eingesetzt sowohl auf extrem zerstörten Pisten als auch auf der Fernstraße. Sie transportieren Zelte, Wasser, Küchenausrüstung, einen Generator, Ersatzräder und Kraftstoff. An Tagen, an denen wir das Camp wechseln, fährt das Begleitfahrzeug voraus, damit das Camp bei Ankunft der Gäste stets vollständig bereit ist.", "At the fixed YurtaDa camps — Kargaly, Assy, Charyn, Altyn-Emel — there is a permanent kitchen, showers, bio-toilets, and autonomous power from a hybrid of solar panels and a diesel generator. Mobile camps mirror this kit on a smaller footprint.": "An den festen YurtaDa-Camps — Kargaly, Assy, Charyn, Altyn-Emel — gibt es eine feste Küche, Duschen, Bio-Toiletten und autarke Stromversorgung aus einem Hybrid aus Solarmodulen und Dieselgenerator. Mobile Camps bilden diese Ausstattung in kleinerem Format ab.", "A dedicated field cook travels on every multi-day expedition. The kitchen module — twin-burner stoves, propane, a tandoor for bread, refrigeration, filtered water, sealed dry-stores — is set up fresh at each camp.": "Auf jeder mehrtägigen Expedition ist ein eigener Feldkoch dabei. Das Küchenmodul — Zweiflammkocher, Propan, ein Tandoor für Brot, Kühlung, gefiltertes Wasser, versiegelte Trockenvorräte — wird an jedem Camp neu aufgebaut.", "Changes with the region of the route — an eagle hunter (berkutchi) in the Altai, a keeper of traditions in Mangystau, an expert in history and legends on the Aral. Joins the expedition for one to three days. Their role is to provide the context of the place — natural, cultural and practical — grounded in local experience and knowledge.": "Wechselt je nach Region der Route — ein Adlerjäger (Berkutchi) im Altai, ein Hüter der Traditionen in Mangystau, ein Kenner der Geschichte und Legenden am Aral. Schließt sich der Expedition für ein bis drei Tage an. Seine Aufgabe ist es, den Kontext des Ortes — natürlich, kulturell und praktisch — zu vermitteln, gestützt auf lokale Erfahrung und lokales Wissen."});
Object.assign(window.I18N.fr, {"Hard caps: up to 12 on expeditions, up to 15 on escapes.": "Limites strictes : jusqu'à 12 en expédition, jusqu'à 15 en escapade.", "Maximum 12 on expeditions, 15 on escapes. You will know the name and the village of the person leading you before you arrive.": "Au maximum 12 en expédition, 15 en escapade. Vous connaîtrez le nom et le village de la personne qui vous guide avant même d'arriver.", "Book by August of the previous year. If your trip is spontaneous, write to us — we will try to arrange it.": "Réservez avant le mois d'août de l'année précédente. Si votre voyage est spontané, écrivez-nous — nous essaierons de l'organiser.", "Off-road-prepared 4×4": "4×4 préparé pour le tout-terrain", "Recovery & evacuation vehicle": "Véhicule de récupération et d'évacuation", "Supply & logistics 4×4": "4×4 de ravitaillement et logistique", "An equipped evacuation vehicle, prepared for heavy off-road.": "Un véhicule d'évacuation équipé, préparé pour le tout-terrain difficile.", "Drives the lead vehicle. Final call on weather, route, evacuation. First-response trained.": "Conduit le véhicule de tête. Décision finale sur la météo, l'itinéraire, l'évacuation. Formé aux premiers secours.", "Drives the second vehicle. Second medical responder, recovery specialist, translator for Kazakh / Russian.": "Conduit le deuxième véhicule. Deuxième secouriste, spécialiste de la récupération, traducteur kazakh / russe.", "Comfortable jeeps prepared for off-road. 3 guests + driver-guide. A classic expedition platform for Central Asian conditions. Extended fuel range, low-range gearing and factory locking differentials give confident progress off-road. Depending on the route, a snorkel and extra preparation for water crossings are fitted.": "Des jeeps confortables préparées pour le tout-terrain. 3 passagers + chauffeur-guide. Une plateforme d'expédition classique pour les conditions d'Asie centrale. Autonomie de carburant accrue, boîte de transfert courte et différentiels à blocage d'usine assurent une progression sûre hors route. Selon l'itinéraire, un schnorchel et une préparation supplémentaire pour les passages à gué sont installés.", "Four-wheel-drive vehicles for technical supply throughout the expedition, used both on extremely broken tracks and on the highway. They carry tents, water, kitchen equipment, a generator, spare wheels and fuel. On days when we move between camps, the support vehicle goes ahead so the camp is always fully ready when guests arrive.": "Des véhicules à quatre roues motrices pour le ravitaillement technique tout au long de l'expédition, utilisés aussi bien sur des pistes extrêmement défoncées que sur la route. Ils transportent tentes, eau, équipement de cuisine, un générateur, roues de secours et carburant. Les jours où l'on change de campement, le véhicule d'assistance part en avant afin que le camp soit toujours entièrement prêt à l'arrivée des voyageurs.", "At the fixed YurtaDa camps — Kargaly, Assy, Charyn, Altyn-Emel — there is a permanent kitchen, showers, bio-toilets, and autonomous power from a hybrid of solar panels and a diesel generator. Mobile camps mirror this kit on a smaller footprint.": "Aux campements fixes YurtaDa — Kargaly, Assy, Charyn, Altyn-Emel — se trouvent une cuisine permanente, des douches, des toilettes sèches et une alimentation autonome par un hybride de panneaux solaires et d'un groupe électrogène diesel. Les campements mobiles reprennent cet équipement dans un format réduit.", "A dedicated field cook travels on every multi-day expedition. The kitchen module — twin-burner stoves, propane, a tandoor for bread, refrigeration, filtered water, sealed dry-stores — is set up fresh at each camp.": "Un cuisinier de terrain dédié accompagne chaque expédition de plusieurs jours. Le module cuisine — réchauds à deux feux, propane, un tandoor à pain, réfrigération, eau filtrée, réserves sèches hermétiques — est réinstallé à chaque campement.", "Changes with the region of the route — an eagle hunter (berkutchi) in the Altai, a keeper of traditions in Mangystau, an expert in history and legends on the Aral. Joins the expedition for one to three days. Their role is to provide the context of the place — natural, cultural and practical — grounded in local experience and knowledge.": "Change selon la région de l'itinéraire — un chasseur à l'aigle (berkutchi) dans l'Altaï, un gardien des traditions au Mangystau, un connaisseur de l'histoire et des légendes sur l'Aral. Rejoint l'expédition pour un à trois jours. Son rôle est d'apporter le contexte du lieu — naturel, culturel et pratique — fondé sur l'expérience et le savoir locaux."});
Object.assign(window.I18N.it, {"Hard caps: up to 12 on expeditions, up to 15 on escapes.": "Limiti rigidi: fino a 12 nelle spedizioni, fino a 15 nelle fughe.", "Maximum 12 on expeditions, 15 on escapes. You will know the name and the village of the person leading you before you arrive.": "Al massimo 12 nelle spedizioni, 15 nelle fughe. Conoscerai il nome e il villaggio di chi ti guida prima ancora di arrivare.", "Book by August of the previous year. If your trip is spontaneous, write to us — we will try to arrange it.": "Prenota entro agosto dell'anno precedente. Se il tuo viaggio è spontaneo, scrivici — cercheremo di organizzarlo.", "Off-road-prepared 4×4": "4×4 preparato per il fuoristrada", "Recovery & evacuation vehicle": "Veicolo di recupero ed evacuazione", "Supply & logistics 4×4": "4×4 per rifornimento e logistica", "An equipped evacuation vehicle, prepared for heavy off-road.": "Un veicolo di evacuazione attrezzato, preparato per il fuoristrada impegnativo.", "Drives the lead vehicle. Final call on weather, route, evacuation. First-response trained.": "Guida il veicolo di testa. Decisione finale su meteo, percorso, evacuazione. Formato al primo soccorso.", "Drives the second vehicle. Second medical responder, recovery specialist, translator for Kazakh / Russian.": "Guida il secondo veicolo. Secondo soccorritore, specialista del recupero, traduttore kazako / russo.", "Comfortable jeeps prepared for off-road. 3 guests + driver-guide. A classic expedition platform for Central Asian conditions. Extended fuel range, low-range gearing and factory locking differentials give confident progress off-road. Depending on the route, a snorkel and extra preparation for water crossings are fitted.": "Jeep confortevoli preparate per il fuoristrada. 3 ospiti + autista-guida. Una classica piattaforma da spedizione per le condizioni dell'Asia centrale. Autonomia di carburante estesa, marce ridotte e differenziali bloccabili di fabbrica garantiscono un avanzamento sicuro in fuoristrada. A seconda del percorso vengono montati uno snorkel e una preparazione extra per i guadi.", "Four-wheel-drive vehicles for technical supply throughout the expedition, used both on extremely broken tracks and on the highway. They carry tents, water, kitchen equipment, a generator, spare wheels and fuel. On days when we move between camps, the support vehicle goes ahead so the camp is always fully ready when guests arrive.": "Veicoli a quattro ruote motrici per il rifornimento tecnico durante tutta la spedizione, usati sia su piste estremamente dissestate sia in autostrada. Trasportano tende, acqua, attrezzatura da cucina, un generatore, ruote di scorta e carburante. Nei giorni in cui ci si sposta tra i campi, il veicolo di supporto va avanti così che il campo sia sempre del tutto pronto all'arrivo degli ospiti.", "At the fixed YurtaDa camps — Kargaly, Assy, Charyn, Altyn-Emel — there is a permanent kitchen, showers, bio-toilets, and autonomous power from a hybrid of solar panels and a diesel generator. Mobile camps mirror this kit on a smaller footprint.": "Nei campi fissi YurtaDa — Kargaly, Assy, Charyn, Altyn-Emel — ci sono una cucina permanente, docce, bio-toilette e alimentazione autonoma da un ibrido di pannelli solari e generatore diesel. I campi mobili replicano questa dotazione in formato ridotto.", "A dedicated field cook travels on every multi-day expedition. The kitchen module — twin-burner stoves, propane, a tandoor for bread, refrigeration, filtered water, sealed dry-stores — is set up fresh at each camp.": "Un cuoco da campo dedicato viaggia in ogni spedizione di più giorni. Il modulo cucina — fornelli a due fuochi, propano, un tandoor per il pane, refrigerazione, acqua filtrata, dispense sigillate — viene allestito da capo a ogni campo.", "Changes with the region of the route — an eagle hunter (berkutchi) in the Altai, a keeper of traditions in Mangystau, an expert in history and legends on the Aral. Joins the expedition for one to three days. Their role is to provide the context of the place — natural, cultural and practical — grounded in local experience and knowledge.": "Cambia a seconda della regione del percorso — un cacciatore con l'aquila (berkutchi) nell'Altai, un custode delle tradizioni nel Mangystau, un esperto di storia e leggende sull'Aral. Si unisce alla spedizione per uno-tre giorni. Il suo ruolo è fornire il contesto del luogo — naturale, culturale e pratico — radicato nell'esperienza e nel sapere locali."});
Object.assign(window.I18N.zh, {"Hard caps: up to 12 on expeditions, up to 15 on escapes.": "严格上限：探险最多 12 人，短途最多 15 人。", "Maximum 12 on expeditions, 15 on escapes. You will know the name and the village of the person leading you before you arrive.": "探险最多 12 人，短途最多 15 人。抵达之前，您就会知道带领您的人的姓名和家乡村落。", "Book by August of the previous year. If your trip is spontaneous, write to us — we will try to arrange it.": "请在前一年8月之前预订。如果是临时起意的行程，写信给我们——我们会尽力安排。", "Off-road-prepared 4×4": "为越野而准备的 4×4", "Recovery & evacuation vehicle": "救援与撤离车辆", "Supply & logistics 4×4": "补给与后勤 4×4", "An equipped evacuation vehicle, prepared for heavy off-road.": "一辆配备齐全的撤离车辆，为重度越野而准备。", "Drives the lead vehicle. Final call on weather, route, evacuation. First-response trained.": "驾驶头车。天气、路线、撤离的最终决定权。受过急救训练。", "Drives the second vehicle. Second medical responder, recovery specialist, translator for Kazakh / Russian.": "驾驶第二辆车。第二急救员、脱困专家、哈萨克语／俄语翻译。", "Comfortable jeeps prepared for off-road. 3 guests + driver-guide. A classic expedition platform for Central Asian conditions. Extended fuel range, low-range gearing and factory locking differentials give confident progress off-road. Depending on the route, a snorkel and extra preparation for water crossings are fitted.": "为越野而备的舒适吉普。3 名乘客 + 司机兼向导。适合中亚路况的经典探险平台。加大的油箱续航、低速挡与出厂差速锁，确保在越野路面稳健通行。视路线加装涉水喉，并为涉水路段做额外准备。", "Four-wheel-drive vehicles for technical supply throughout the expedition, used both on extremely broken tracks and on the highway. They carry tents, water, kitchen equipment, a generator, spare wheels and fuel. On days when we move between camps, the support vehicle goes ahead so the camp is always fully ready when guests arrive.": "贯穿整段考察的四驱技术补给车，既走极度破损的土路，也上公路。它们运载帐篷、饮水、厨房设备、发电机、备胎和燃料。在营地转移的日子里，补给车提前出发，让营地在宾客抵达时总是完全就绪。", "At the fixed YurtaDa camps — Kargaly, Assy, Charyn, Altyn-Emel — there is a permanent kitchen, showers, bio-toilets, and autonomous power from a hybrid of solar panels and a diesel generator. Mobile camps mirror this kit on a smaller footprint.": "在 YurtaDa 固定营地——卡尔加雷、阿瑟、恰伦、阿尔泰恩-埃梅尔——设有固定厨房、淋浴、生态厕所，以及由太阳能板与柴油发电机组成的混合系统供给的自主电力。移动营地在更小的规模上复制这套配置。", "A dedicated field cook travels on every multi-day expedition. The kitchen module — twin-burner stoves, propane, a tandoor for bread, refrigeration, filtered water, sealed dry-stores — is set up fresh at each camp.": "每次多日考察都有专属的野外厨师随行。厨房模块——双灶炉、丙烷、烤馕坑、冷藏、过滤水、密封干货储存——在每处营地重新搭设。", "Changes with the region of the route — an eagle hunter (berkutchi) in the Altai, a keeper of traditions in Mangystau, an expert in history and legends on the Aral. Joins the expedition for one to three days. Their role is to provide the context of the place — natural, cultural and practical — grounded in local experience and knowledge.": "随路线所在地区而变——阿尔泰的驯鹰人（berkutchi）、曼格斯套的传统守护者、咸海的历史与传说通。加入考察一至三天。其职责是提供当地的脉络——自然、文化与实用——根植于本地经验与知识。"});
Object.assign(window.I18N.ja, {"Hard caps: up to 12 on expeditions, up to 15 on escapes.": "厳格な上限：遠征は最大12名、短期エスケープは最大15名。", "Maximum 12 on expeditions, 15 on escapes. You will know the name and the village of the person leading you before you arrive.": "遠征は最大12名、短期エスケープは最大15名。到着前に、あなたを導く人の名前と出身の村がわかります。", "Book by August of the previous year. If your trip is spontaneous, write to us — we will try to arrange it.": "前年の8月までにご予約ください。旅が急なものであれば、ご連絡ください——手配できるよう努めます。", "Off-road-prepared 4×4": "オフロード仕様の4×4", "Recovery & evacuation vehicle": "回収・避難用車両", "Supply & logistics 4×4": "補給・ロジスティクス用4×4", "An equipped evacuation vehicle, prepared for heavy off-road.": "装備を整えた避難用車両。過酷なオフロードに備えています。", "Drives the lead vehicle. Final call on weather, route, evacuation. First-response trained.": "先頭車両を運転。天候・ルート・避難の最終判断を担う。応急処置の訓練済み。", "Drives the second vehicle. Second medical responder, recovery specialist, translator for Kazakh / Russian.": "2台目の車両を運転。第二の救急対応者、リカバリー専門、カザフ語／ロシア語の通訳。", "Comfortable jeeps prepared for off-road. 3 guests + driver-guide. A classic expedition platform for Central Asian conditions. Extended fuel range, low-range gearing and factory locking differentials give confident progress off-road. Depending on the route, a snorkel and extra preparation for water crossings are fitted.": "オフロード向けに整えた快適なジープ。乗客3名＋ドライバー兼ガイド。中央アジアの路況に適した定番の遠征プラットフォーム。長距離燃料、ローレンジギア、工場装着のデフロックにより、オフロードでも確実に前進します。ルートに応じてシュノーケルと渡渉用の追加装備を取り付けます。", "Four-wheel-drive vehicles for technical supply throughout the expedition, used both on extremely broken tracks and on the highway. They carry tents, water, kitchen equipment, a generator, spare wheels and fuel. On days when we move between camps, the support vehicle goes ahead so the camp is always fully ready when guests arrive.": "遠征全体を通じて技術補給を担う四輪駆動車。極端に荒れた道でも幹線道路でも走ります。テント、水、厨房機材、発電機、スペアタイヤ、燃料を運びます。キャンプ間を移動する日には、サポート車が先行し、ゲスト到着時にキャンプが常に完全に整っているようにします。", "At the fixed YurtaDa camps — Kargaly, Assy, Charyn, Altyn-Emel — there is a permanent kitchen, showers, bio-toilets, and autonomous power from a hybrid of solar panels and a diesel generator. Mobile camps mirror this kit on a smaller footprint.": "YurtaDa の固定キャンプ——カルガリ、アスィ、チャリン、アルティン・エメル——には、常設の厨房、シャワー、バイオトイレ、そして太陽光パネルとディーゼル発電機のハイブリッドによる自立電源があります。移動式キャンプはこの装備をより小さな規模で再現します。", "A dedicated field cook travels on every multi-day expedition. The kitchen module — twin-burner stoves, propane, a tandoor for bread, refrigeration, filtered water, sealed dry-stores — is set up fresh at each camp.": "数日にわたる遠征には必ず専属のフィールドコックが同行します。キッチンモジュール——二口コンロ、プロパン、パン用タンドール、冷蔵、ろ過水、密閉式の乾物庫——は各キャンプで新たに設営されます。", "Changes with the region of the route — an eagle hunter (berkutchi) in the Altai, a keeper of traditions in Mangystau, an expert in history and legends on the Aral. Joins the expedition for one to three days. Their role is to provide the context of the place — natural, cultural and practical — grounded in local experience and knowledge.": "ルートの地域によって替わります——アルタイの鷹匠（ベルクチ）、マンギスタウの伝統の守り手、アラルの歴史と伝説の専門家。1〜3日、遠征に加わります。その役割は、その土地の文脈——自然的・文化的・実際的な——を、地域の経験と知識に根ざして伝えることです。"});
Object.assign(window.I18N.ko, {"Hard caps: up to 12 on expeditions, up to 15 on escapes.": "엄격한 상한: 탐험 최대 12명, 단기 이스케이프 최대 15명.", "Maximum 12 on expeditions, 15 on escapes. You will know the name and the village of the person leading you before you arrive.": "탐험 최대 12명, 단기 이스케이프 최대 15명. 도착 전에 당신을 이끌 사람의 이름과 마을을 알게 됩니다.", "Book by August of the previous year. If your trip is spontaneous, write to us — we will try to arrange it.": "전년도 8월까지 예약하세요. 여행이 즉흥적이라면 저희에게 연락 주세요 — 최대한 마련해 보겠습니다.", "Off-road-prepared 4×4": "오프로드 대비 4×4", "Recovery & evacuation vehicle": "구난·대피 차량", "Supply & logistics 4×4": "보급·물류 4×4", "An equipped evacuation vehicle, prepared for heavy off-road.": "장비를 갖춘 대피 차량으로, 험한 오프로드에 대비되어 있습니다.", "Drives the lead vehicle. Final call on weather, route, evacuation. First-response trained.": "선두 차량을 운전합니다. 날씨·경로·대피에 대한 최종 결정권. 응급처치 교육 이수.", "Drives the second vehicle. Second medical responder, recovery specialist, translator for Kazakh / Russian.": "두 번째 차량을 운전합니다. 제2 응급요원, 구난 전문가, 카자흐어／러시아어 통역.", "Comfortable jeeps prepared for off-road. 3 guests + driver-guide. A classic expedition platform for Central Asian conditions. Extended fuel range, low-range gearing and factory locking differentials give confident progress off-road. Depending on the route, a snorkel and extra preparation for water crossings are fitted.": "오프로드를 위해 준비된 편안한 지프. 승객 3명 + 운전 겸 가이드. 중앙아시아 노면에 맞는 전형적인 탐험 플랫폼. 늘어난 연료 주행거리, 저단 기어, 공장 장착 차동잠금장치로 오프로드에서도 확실하게 나아갑니다. 경로에 따라 스노클과 도하용 추가 장비를 장착합니다.", "Four-wheel-drive vehicles for technical supply throughout the expedition, used both on extremely broken tracks and on the highway. They carry tents, water, kitchen equipment, a generator, spare wheels and fuel. On days when we move between camps, the support vehicle goes ahead so the camp is always fully ready when guests arrive.": "탐험 내내 기술 보급을 맡는 사륜구동 차량으로, 극도로 파손된 길과 고속도로 모두에서 운행합니다. 텐트, 물, 주방 장비, 발전기, 예비 타이어, 연료를 싣습니다. 캠프를 옮기는 날에는 지원 차량이 먼저 출발해, 손님이 도착할 때 캠프가 항상 완전히 준비되어 있게 합니다.", "At the fixed YurtaDa camps — Kargaly, Assy, Charyn, Altyn-Emel — there is a permanent kitchen, showers, bio-toilets, and autonomous power from a hybrid of solar panels and a diesel generator. Mobile camps mirror this kit on a smaller footprint.": "YurtaDa 고정 캠프 — 카르갈리, 아스, 차린, 알틴-에멜 — 에는 상설 주방, 샤워실, 바이오 화장실, 그리고 태양광 패널과 디젤 발전기의 하이브리드로 공급되는 자립 전력이 있습니다. 이동식 캠프는 이 장비를 더 작은 규모로 갖춥니다.", "A dedicated field cook travels on every multi-day expedition. The kitchen module — twin-burner stoves, propane, a tandoor for bread, refrigeration, filtered water, sealed dry-stores — is set up fresh at each camp.": "여러 날에 걸친 모든 탐험에는 전담 야전 요리사가 동행합니다. 주방 모듈 — 2구 버너, 프로판, 빵용 탄두르, 냉장, 여과수, 밀폐 건조 저장고 — 은 각 캠프마다 새로 설치됩니다.", "Changes with the region of the route — an eagle hunter (berkutchi) in the Altai, a keeper of traditions in Mangystau, an expert in history and legends on the Aral. Joins the expedition for one to three days. Their role is to provide the context of the place — natural, cultural and practical — grounded in local experience and knowledge.": "경로의 지역에 따라 바뀝니다 — 알타이의 독수리 사냥꾼(베르쿠치), 망기스타우의 전통 수호자, 아랄의 역사와 전설 전문가. 1~3일 동안 탐험에 합류합니다. 그 역할은 그 장소의 맥락 — 자연적·문화적·실용적 — 을 현지 경험과 지식에 뿌리내려 전하는 것입니다."});
Object.assign(window.I18N.ar, {"Hard caps: up to 12 on expeditions, up to 15 on escapes.": "حدود صارمة: حتى 12 في الرحلات، وحتى 15 في الرحلات القصيرة.", "Maximum 12 on expeditions, 15 on escapes. You will know the name and the village of the person leading you before you arrive.": "بحدٍّ أقصى 12 في الرحلات و15 في الرحلات القصيرة. ستعرف اسم مَن يقودك وقريته قبل وصولك.", "Book by August of the previous year. If your trip is spontaneous, write to us — we will try to arrange it.": "احجز قبل أغسطس من العام السابق. وإن كانت رحلتك عفوية — راسِلنا وسنحاول ترتيبها.", "Off-road-prepared 4×4": "دفع رباعي مُجهَّز للطرق الوعرة", "Recovery & evacuation vehicle": "مركبة إنقاذ وإخلاء", "Supply & logistics 4×4": "دفع رباعي للإمداد واللوجستيات", "An equipped evacuation vehicle, prepared for heavy off-road.": "مركبة إخلاء مجهّزة، معدّة للطرق الوعرة الصعبة.", "Drives the lead vehicle. Final call on weather, route, evacuation. First-response trained.": "يقود المركبة الأمامية. القرار النهائي في الطقس والمسار والإخلاء. مُدرَّب على الإسعافات الأولية.", "Drives the second vehicle. Second medical responder, recovery specialist, translator for Kazakh / Russian.": "يقود المركبة الثانية. مسعف ثانٍ، وأخصائي إنقاذ، ومترجم للكازاخية / الروسية.", "Comfortable jeeps prepared for off-road. 3 guests + driver-guide. A classic expedition platform for Central Asian conditions. Extended fuel range, low-range gearing and factory locking differentials give confident progress off-road. Depending on the route, a snorkel and extra preparation for water crossings are fitted.": "سيارات جيب مريحة معدّة للطرق الوعرة. 3 ضيوف + سائق-مرشد. منصّة استكشافية كلاسيكية تناسب ظروف آسيا الوسطى. مدى وقود موسّع، وتعشيق منخفض، وقوافل تفاضلية مقفلة من المصنع تمنح تقدّمًا واثقًا على الطرق الوعرة. وبحسب المسار، يُركَّب أنبوب هواء (شنوركل) وتجهيزات إضافية لعبور المياه.", "Four-wheel-drive vehicles for technical supply throughout the expedition, used both on extremely broken tracks and on the highway. They carry tents, water, kitchen equipment, a generator, spare wheels and fuel. On days when we move between camps, the support vehicle goes ahead so the camp is always fully ready when guests arrive.": "مركبات دفع رباعي للإمداد الفنّي طوال الرحلة، تُستخدم على المسارات شديدة الوعورة وعلى الطريق السريع معًا. تحمل الخيام والماء ومعدّات المطبخ ومولّدًا وإطارات احتياطية ووقودًا. وفي أيام الانتقال بين المخيّمات، تتقدّم مركبة الدعم أولًا كي يكون المخيّم جاهزًا تمامًا دائمًا عند وصول الضيوف.", "At the fixed YurtaDa camps — Kargaly, Assy, Charyn, Altyn-Emel — there is a permanent kitchen, showers, bio-toilets, and autonomous power from a hybrid of solar panels and a diesel generator. Mobile camps mirror this kit on a smaller footprint.": "في مخيّمات YurtaDa الثابتة — كارغالي، وأسي، وتشارين، وألتين-إيميل — يوجد مطبخ دائم ودُشّات ومراحيض حيوية وطاقة مستقلّة من نظام هجين يجمع بين الألواح الشمسية ومولّد ديزل. وتُحاكي المخيّمات المتنقّلة هذا التجهيز بحجم أصغر.", "A dedicated field cook travels on every multi-day expedition. The kitchen module — twin-burner stoves, propane, a tandoor for bread, refrigeration, filtered water, sealed dry-stores — is set up fresh at each camp.": "يرافق كل رحلة تمتدّ عدّة أيام طاهٍ ميداني مخصّص. وتُنصَب وحدة المطبخ — موقدان، وغاز بروبان، وتنّور للخبز، وتبريد، وماء مُرشَّح، ومخازن جافة محكمة — من جديد في كل مخيّم.", "Changes with the region of the route — an eagle hunter (berkutchi) in the Altai, a keeper of traditions in Mangystau, an expert in history and legends on the Aral. Joins the expedition for one to three days. Their role is to provide the context of the place — natural, cultural and practical — grounded in local experience and knowledge.": "يتغيّر بحسب منطقة المسار — صيّاد بالنسور (بيركوتشي) في ألتاي، وحارس تقاليد في مانغيستاو، وخبير في التاريخ والأساطير على آرال. ينضمّ إلى الرحلة لمدّة يوم إلى ثلاثة أيام. ودوره أن يوفّر سياق المكان — الطبيعي والثقافي والعملي — مستندًا إلى الخبرة والمعرفة المحليتين."});
Object.assign(window.I18N.es, {"Hard caps: up to 12 on expeditions, up to 15 on escapes.": "Límites estrictos: hasta 12 en expediciones, hasta 15 en escapadas.", "Maximum 12 on expeditions, 15 on escapes. You will know the name and the village of the person leading you before you arrive.": "Máximo 12 en expediciones, 15 en escapadas. Conocerá el nombre y la aldea de quien le guía antes de llegar.", "Book by August of the previous year. If your trip is spontaneous, write to us — we will try to arrange it.": "Reserve antes de agosto del año anterior. Si su viaje es espontáneo, escríbanos — intentaremos organizarlo.", "Off-road-prepared 4×4": "4×4 preparado para todoterreno", "Recovery & evacuation vehicle": "Vehículo de rescate y evacuación", "Supply & logistics 4×4": "4×4 de suministro y logística", "An equipped evacuation vehicle, prepared for heavy off-road.": "Un vehículo de evacuación equipado, preparado para todoterreno exigente.", "Drives the lead vehicle. Final call on weather, route, evacuation. First-response trained.": "Conduce el vehículo de cabeza. Decisión final sobre clima, ruta y evacuación. Formado en primeros auxilios.", "Drives the second vehicle. Second medical responder, recovery specialist, translator for Kazakh / Russian.": "Conduce el segundo vehículo. Segundo socorrista, especialista en rescate, traductor de kazajo / ruso.", "Comfortable jeeps prepared for off-road. 3 guests + driver-guide. A classic expedition platform for Central Asian conditions. Extended fuel range, low-range gearing and factory locking differentials give confident progress off-road. Depending on the route, a snorkel and extra preparation for water crossings are fitted.": "Jeeps cómodos preparados para el todoterreno. 3 pasajeros + conductor-guía. Una plataforma de expedición clásica para las condiciones de Asia Central. Mayor autonomía de combustible, caja reductora y diferenciales de bloqueo de fábrica dan un avance seguro fuera de pista. Según la ruta, se montan un esnórquel y preparación adicional para los vadeos.", "Four-wheel-drive vehicles for technical supply throughout the expedition, used both on extremely broken tracks and on the highway. They carry tents, water, kitchen equipment, a generator, spare wheels and fuel. On days when we move between camps, the support vehicle goes ahead so the camp is always fully ready when guests arrive.": "Vehículos con tracción a las cuatro ruedas para el suministro técnico durante toda la expedición, usados tanto en pistas extremadamente destrozadas como en carretera. Transportan tiendas, agua, equipo de cocina, un generador, ruedas de repuesto y combustible. Los días en que cambiamos de campamento, el vehículo de apoyo se adelanta para que el campamento esté siempre totalmente listo a la llegada de los huéspedes.", "At the fixed YurtaDa camps — Kargaly, Assy, Charyn, Altyn-Emel — there is a permanent kitchen, showers, bio-toilets, and autonomous power from a hybrid of solar panels and a diesel generator. Mobile camps mirror this kit on a smaller footprint.": "En los campamentos fijos YurtaDa — Kargaly, Assy, Charyn, Altyn-Emel — hay cocina permanente, duchas, bio-inodoros y energía autónoma de un híbrido de paneles solares y un generador diésel. Los campamentos móviles reproducen este equipamiento en un formato más reducido.", "A dedicated field cook travels on every multi-day expedition. The kitchen module — twin-burner stoves, propane, a tandoor for bread, refrigeration, filtered water, sealed dry-stores — is set up fresh at each camp.": "Un cocinero de campo dedicado viaja en cada expedición de varios días. El módulo de cocina — hornillos de dos fuegos, propano, un tandoor para el pan, refrigeración, agua filtrada, despensas selladas — se monta de nuevo en cada campamento.", "Changes with the region of the route — an eagle hunter (berkutchi) in the Altai, a keeper of traditions in Mangystau, an expert in history and legends on the Aral. Joins the expedition for one to three days. Their role is to provide the context of the place — natural, cultural and practical — grounded in local experience and knowledge.": "Cambia según la región de la ruta — un cazador con águila (berkutchi) en el Altái, un guardián de las tradiciones en Mangystau, un experto en historia y leyendas en el Aral. Se une a la expedición de uno a tres días. Su papel es aportar el contexto del lugar — natural, cultural y práctico — arraigado en la experiencia y el saber locales."});
